<li aria-level=3D"1">Fixed antennas and handheld scanners track the pet thr=
ough every crematorium station.<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Owners receive updates at each step, from pickup to wh=
en the ashes are ready.</li>
</ul>
